     moves them to the first artist position, so the track routes to Artists/<that artist>.
     Example: "YS; Kanye West; Ty Dolla Sign" becomes "Kanye West; YS; Ty Dolla Sign". -->
<PrimaryFirst>
  <Artist name="Kanye West" />
</PrimaryFirst>
